We'll use the same simple pattern as your working Employee–Bonus project: Spring Boot + MongoDB + Vue.js, with two models, two repositories, one controller, and no service class.

The GET API will return a list of customers (`custid` and `name`) who have chosen veg food. We'll match `custid` between the `foodorders` and `customer` collections.

### 1\. Backend — Spring Boot

